Changes include explicit library path and digest checks, private fixed-scope key
manifest, suppressed native diagnostics, removed CLI self-test/discovery helpers,
and stable errors. Runtime capture and bootstrap were adapted from the reviewed
successful private workflow, not copied wholesale from the public wrappers.
The public wrappers' recursive account/database discovery, deep signing,
force-kill cleanup and raw error output are not included. No UI-send or media
pipeline implementation is included.

Content/rendering behavior was adapted from individually reviewed private work
created for this export workflow. Personal identifiers, local paths and run state
were removed. That code is not claimed to be verbatim upstream or a clean-room
implementation. Per-file review and hashes are documented in docs/SOURCES.md.

